=== [0] staging validation (miranda x cuszp_1e3, one run per arm) ===

--- arm=devres ---
[device] miranda: 288.0 MiB resident on GPU (0x147318000000)
[arm devres] VOL receives the DEVICE pointer; no input copy, only compressed output crosses PCIe

--- arm=rtrip ---
[device] miranda: 288.0 MiB resident on GPU (0x14b306000000)
[arm rtrip] D2H happens INSIDE write_ms, then libpressio moves it back H2D: the array crosses PCIe twice

--- arm=hostsim ---
[arm hostsim] plain host buffer; one H2D inside the codec

--- expected per arm ---
  devres   [arm devres] + [stage] 'input left device-resident'
  rtrip    [arm rtrip]  + [stage] 'H2D host->device'  (the D2H is in the
           benchmark, inside write_ms, so the connector only sees the H2D)
  hostsim  [arm hostsim]+ [stage] 'H2D host->device'

